From: batocera <none@invalid>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:05:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Allow pinning gamepads to ports by device path

Add an Input.PortN.DevicePath setting. At startup the gamepads whose
SDL joystick path matches a port's DevicePath are opened and assigned
to that port, so the player order no longer depends on the order in
which the devices are enumerated. Other gamepads take the lowest free
player index as they are added.

The gamepad map and player index map move into App so that they can be
filled before the event loop starts.
